# Holdout-contaminated backtest runs, quarantined 2026-07-26 (dispatch W5).
# Two run dirs whose declared range crosses holdout_range's 2026-01-01 start
# (campaign_data_policy.yaml:holdout_contaminated_runs). Moved here intact, never
# deleted. Excluded from publication for the same reason holdout_sealed/ is: these
# outputs already consumed holdout bars, and the pre-commit content gate would
# reject them anyway. Chronology: the runs PREDATE the seal by ~90 minutes.
strategy-research/quarantine/holdout_contaminated/

# oh-my-claudecode operational state (Dorian's fork only — Jeremy's tree has none).
# Session state, HUD caches, subagent tracking, mission/PRD scratch. Machine-local
# runtime artifacts, regenerated on demand, never source. Three of these exist
# (repo root, trading-bot/, strategy-research/) and the pattern covers any depth.
# Note: if project-scoped OMC skills are ever wanted under .omc/skills/, they need
# an explicit exception — a directory excluded here cannot be re-included by a
# later negation.
.omc/

# basedpyright project config (Dorian's fork only — machine-local tool wiring
# pointing diagnostics at the Mac .venv; Jeremy's tree has none). FORK_CHANGES row 24.
/pyrightconfig.json
